WEBVTT

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:08.147
Tonight we have
gathered here

00:00:08.396 --> 00:00:12.396
to do the Puja to
the Devi,

00:00:12.605 --> 00:00:15.272
that is Mahakali
- we can call Her

00:00:15.438 --> 00:00:19.980
or Durga.

00:00:20.522 --> 00:00:24.814
So many types of
forms She has taken,

00:00:25.106 --> 00:00:27.272
to kill

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:33.314
the negative forces that
are trying to trouble

00:00:33.522 --> 00:00:36.147
or to obstruct,

00:00:36.396 --> 00:00:40.314
or even to grow

00:00:40.522 --> 00:00:45.189
the people who were

00:00:46.147 --> 00:00:49.855
gentle and good.

00:00:53.189 --> 00:00:56.231
Her forms are of
different types

00:00:56.438 --> 00:00:59.314
that we know about,

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:03.897
that She destroyed
so many rakshasas,

00:01:04.147 --> 00:01:07.563
She destroyed so
many evildoers.

00:01:07.772 --> 00:01:10.147
Also we do not know

00:01:10.396 --> 00:01:14.022
that, in the World
Wars that we had,

00:01:14.272 --> 00:01:19.814
She was there to protect
the right type of people.

00:01:20.064 --> 00:01:23.356
And that’s how
they all survived

00:01:23.522 --> 00:01:27.396
the ill-blood plan,

00:01:27.605 --> 00:01:31.647
ill-gotten plan
of very cruel

00:01:31.897 --> 00:01:34.939
and evil people.

00:01:36.356 --> 00:01:40.231
The evil people have
a capacity to hate.

00:01:40.438 --> 00:01:46.231
And to express their hate in
every way that is possible.

00:01:46.772 --> 00:01:54.438
They are really born evil and
there are also who ‘become’ evil.

00:01:55.064 --> 00:01:58.980
When they are

00:02:00.022 --> 00:02:04.814
born evil, you can
make them out.

00:02:05.022 --> 00:02:09.106
That their whole style
is so aggressive,

00:02:09.356 --> 00:02:13.688
and so vindictive

00:02:13.939 --> 00:02:15.647
about things.

00:02:15.897 --> 00:02:19.730
But hatred has no limit,

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:24.855
no limits at all.
Because, if they hate,

00:02:25.064 --> 00:02:28.480
if they hate someone,

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:35.314
then, just to justify that hatred,
they’ll say all kinds of things.

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:40.897
Just to justify. But sometimes
they don’t even want to justify.

00:02:41.147 --> 00:02:43.231
They just feel that
they ‘hate’

00:02:43.438 --> 00:02:47.231
and it’s a fundamental right
they have got to hate.

00:02:47.438 --> 00:02:52.855
But these forces join
together sometimes to form

00:02:53.064 --> 00:02:58.314
to form a joint
personality of evil,

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:03.730
which tries to torture the
human beings and trouble them.

00:03:03.939 --> 00:03:09.189
They might take any name. They
might call them by anything,

00:03:09.396 --> 00:03:14.814
but they are absolutely
hundred per cent evil.

00:03:15.106 --> 00:03:17.231
and for such persons

00:03:17.396 --> 00:03:25.647
there’s no pity or compassion
from the God Almighty.

00:03:25.897 --> 00:03:28.272
These are to be
destroyed.

00:03:28.438 --> 00:03:30.980
And that is the job
of the Goddess

00:03:31.231 --> 00:03:37.397
to destroy them, who is a Mother,
full of compassion and love.

00:03:38.064 --> 00:03:42.605
It’s a very contradictory
work the Goddess has to do

00:03:42.855 --> 00:03:48.231
to kill these people, because, in
the larger interest, it is important

00:03:48.438 --> 00:03:55.897
that all such evil people
should be destroyed, completely.

00:03:56.189 --> 00:03:58.855
But they do not.

00:03:59.147 --> 00:04:02.939
They, like they go to jail for
some time. Like that, they

00:04:03.231 --> 00:04:05.272
go to hell for some
time, suffer

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:08.189
and, again, they come
back much more strong

00:04:08.396 --> 00:04:13.980
and then again try to trouble
good saintly people.

00:04:14.231 --> 00:04:17.106
It’s a common style

00:04:17.314 --> 00:04:23.563
they are all over the world.
They can come in the form

00:04:23.855 --> 00:04:26.022
of a very good man,

00:04:26.231 --> 00:04:30.897
of a very gentle man, or of a
man who “knows a lot about God”

00:04:31.106 --> 00:04:35.231
or they can also say
that they can

00:04:35.522 --> 00:04:38.022
give you Realisation.

00:04:38.396 --> 00:04:41.855
All kinds of lies
they are capable of,

00:04:42.189 --> 00:04:47.647
because they have that power
evil, power of doing evil.

00:04:47.855 --> 00:04:50.939
So they take to all
kinds of falsehood

00:04:51.147 --> 00:04:54.897
and they proclaim that:
“We are this and we are that,”

00:04:55.147 --> 00:04:59.605
and “ We can give
you this or that.”

00:05:00.688 --> 00:05:04.605
Actually, they have come on
this Earth to ruin people.

00:05:04.855 --> 00:05:08.022
We’ve had many of
these false people

00:05:08.272 --> 00:05:11.522
and many stupid
people followed them.

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:14.814
They never talked
against each other.

00:05:15.064 --> 00:05:19.064
Christ has said that,

00:05:19.522 --> 00:05:23.064
“The devil won’t talk
against its own house.”

00:05:23.356 --> 00:05:27.563
As if they are in ‘one’ house.
And in ‘one’ house they live

00:05:27.814 --> 00:05:29.647
and they cannot talk,

00:05:29.855 --> 00:05:35.814
they cannot talk
of something

00:05:36.064 --> 00:05:40.272
that may disturb their
collectivity or their fraternity.

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:44.064
The fraternity is so
great that,

00:05:44.272 --> 00:05:47.189
wherever they are,
they ‘know’

00:05:47.438 --> 00:05:52.231
that they are together.
Just imagine.

00:05:52.438 --> 00:05:55.396
all the evil people
should join together

00:05:55.605 --> 00:05:59.814
and behave in this manner
is very surprising.

00:06:00.189 --> 00:06:02.189
That way, they are
very collective.

00:06:02.397 --> 00:06:07.980
Supposing one has taken a
particular part of the land,

00:06:08.272 --> 00:06:11.647
then he dominates there. Another
takes up in another way.

00:06:11.855 --> 00:06:15.022
Third one takes. There’s
no competition as such.

00:06:15.356 --> 00:06:18.855
Ultimate effort is, somehow
or other,

00:06:19.147 --> 00:06:23.314
to destroy all the
creation of God,

00:06:23.522 --> 00:06:25.563
all the good people
of the world,

00:06:25.772 --> 00:06:31.438
who will ultimately get
their Self-Realisation

00:06:31.647 --> 00:06:37.522
and who will have the
Knowledge about Reality.

00:06:38.397 --> 00:06:44.647
This kind of atmosphere is
the worst during Kali Yuga

00:06:44.939 --> 00:06:48.231
and there are so many
stupid, stupid people,

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:51.438
who may be simple, who
may be good-natured,

00:06:51.730 --> 00:06:56.688
but they get drawn by the
evil doing of these people,

00:06:57.064 --> 00:07:01.106
while the good people
also sometimes

00:07:01.356 --> 00:07:05.647
follow suite. They also try to
follow them. It’s very surprising.

00:07:05.897 --> 00:07:10.397
Why should good people not under-
stand what is good and what is bad?

00:07:10.605 --> 00:07:13.897
But, that discrimination,
many good people also lack

00:07:14.147 --> 00:07:17.022
and that’s why they
take to wrong things.

00:07:17.272 --> 00:07:20.231
And then they go on
justifying all the time

00:07:20.397 --> 00:07:22.939
whatever they are doing
is the right thing,

00:07:23.147 --> 00:07:27.480
is the best thing, they
have the proof of it.

00:07:28.688 --> 00:07:33.480
Now, as you know, there has
been many of them in Kali Yuga

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:39.272
and so many of them have now
disappeared from this Earth

00:07:39.647 --> 00:07:45.147
and now they cannot trouble us.
But there are still some more,

00:07:45.438 --> 00:07:47.438
who are exposed.

00:07:47.688 --> 00:07:51.647
People have exposed
them so much

00:07:51.897 --> 00:07:54.897
that nobody can expose

00:07:55.356 --> 00:07:59.314
anybody without any proof.

00:07:59.522 --> 00:08:01.563
But they have such courage

00:08:01.772 --> 00:08:05.772
and they are so
full of confidence

00:08:06.022 --> 00:08:09.314
that they can do
what they like,

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:11.980
and anybody tries
to expose them,

00:08:12.189 --> 00:08:16.064
they will definitely
ruin that person.

00:08:16.396 --> 00:08:18.522
A few things they
are doing.

00:08:18.772 --> 00:08:23.231
First of all, they put wrong
ideas into your head.

00:08:23.522 --> 00:08:26.522
They say that:
"We are very

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:30.064
great people we are this, we
are that. God has sent us."

00:08:30.272 --> 00:08:32.064
All sorts of things they will talk.

00:08:32.314 --> 00:08:34.855
But there is no proof
about it.

00:08:35.064 --> 00:08:38.189
And human beings never
ask for the proof,

00:08:38.396 --> 00:08:40.855
as to: “How do you say?

00:08:41.064 --> 00:08:43.064
What is the proof? ”

00:08:43.356 --> 00:08:46.397
So the solution is
the Sahaja Yoga.

00:08:46.688 --> 00:08:51.688
In Sahaja Yoga, you have
the experience. You have the proof.

00:08:51.939 --> 00:08:54.855
Then you grow into it.

00:08:55.106 --> 00:08:59.106
Immediately you cannot be a great
Sahaja Yogi, that’s a fact.

00:08:59.356 --> 00:09:01.438
You have to mature.

00:09:01.688 --> 00:09:03.855
It takes some time
for some people.

00:09:04.064 --> 00:09:07.314
It takes some more time for
other people. It doesn’t matter.

00:09:07.605 --> 00:09:09.480
But you do mature.

00:09:09.688 --> 00:09:13.272
In the meanwhile, if you try
to go to these wrong people,

00:09:13.438 --> 00:09:15.855
then there is
no possibility,

00:09:16.147 --> 00:09:19.647
there’s no way of
again bringing you up.

00:09:19.855 --> 00:09:23.356
Especially those people who rise
high in Sahaja Yoga, I think.

00:09:23.522 --> 00:09:27.314
If they fall,
they fall so low.

00:09:27.563 --> 00:09:30.397
Then even an ordinary
Sahaja Yogi

00:09:30.605 --> 00:09:33.897
could say: “ Mother, look at him!
Where has he gone?”

00:09:34.231 --> 00:09:38.189
So, with all these
things happening,

00:09:39.397 --> 00:09:43.563
what is our job

00:09:44.106 --> 00:09:47.356
is to worship
Mahakali within us.

00:09:47.605 --> 00:09:52.272
Because, what does She do?
Perhaps we are not very aware of.

00:09:52.647 --> 00:09:57.605
First and foremost thing
She does is to protect us.

00:09:57.855 --> 00:10:02.064
Wherever you may be,
whatever you may be doing,

00:10:02.272 --> 00:10:05.272
in whatever peril you
may be,

00:10:05.522 --> 00:10:09.647
howsoever dangerously you
may be placed in life,

00:10:09.897 --> 00:10:13.897
She protects you. First
thing, She protects you.

00:10:14.147 --> 00:10:17.563
All the people who write to
Me, how they were protected,

00:10:17.772 --> 00:10:21.106
how they were cured,
how they were helped.

00:10:21.356 --> 00:10:23.939
It’s this thing: that
they should know

00:10:24.147 --> 00:10:29.647
that all this has happened because
of Mahakali power within you.

00:10:30.022 --> 00:10:32.272
She exists within you.

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:34.396
When you are
worshipping Mahakali,

00:10:34.563 --> 00:10:36.980
you are worshipping the
Mahakali ‘within you’.

00:10:37.189 --> 00:10:39.189
With due respect,
you must know

00:10:39.396 --> 00:10:42.814
that this Mahakali is a
very sensitive personality.

00:10:43.106 --> 00:10:45.396
She is very sensitive.

00:10:45.647 --> 00:10:50.231
If you try to do any
wrong to anyone,

00:10:50.688 --> 00:10:54.272
She’ll guide you. She’ll tell
you by many ways

00:10:54.438 --> 00:10:55.814
that: "This is wrong what
you are doing.

00:10:56.022 --> 00:10:58.814
Why are you doing wrong
to some person?”

00:10:59.189 --> 00:11:01.189
But if you do not repent

00:11:01.396 --> 00:11:05.772
and come back onto the normal
position, She gives you up.

00:11:06.356 --> 00:11:10.855
Once Mahakali gives you
up, you are now exposed

00:11:11.106 --> 00:11:15.231
and become prone to all
kinds of evil things.

00:11:15.438 --> 00:11:17.897
I would say…

00:11:21.064 --> 00:11:24.189
“What’s the matter
with the baby?”

00:11:46.022 --> 00:11:48.605
So, when you worship
Her, what do you want?

00:11:48.814 --> 00:11:54.106
You want Her to protect you.
In your discrimination,

00:11:54.396 --> 00:11:58.814
in your mistake, you might
do something wrong.

00:11:59.064 --> 00:12:03.189
May do something that
is not good for you,

00:12:03.397 --> 00:12:06.272
could be very dangerous
for you.

00:12:06.522 --> 00:12:09.605
But She is the person
who guides

00:12:09.814 --> 00:12:11.980
how to avoid all
the dangers.

00:12:13.231 --> 00:12:16.897
Now, She protects
your life,

00:12:17.147 --> 00:12:19.147
She protects your body,

00:12:19.396 --> 00:12:22.396
She protects all organs
of your body,

00:12:22.605 --> 00:12:27.647
She is the One who gives you
all the security of life.

00:12:28.647 --> 00:12:34.022
In Her realm, you feel
completely secure.

00:12:34.314 --> 00:12:37.064
You are never afraid
of anything.

00:12:37.314 --> 00:12:41.022
Because you have left Her
realm, you have come out of it,

00:12:41.231 --> 00:12:44.314
that is why, that is the
reason you are afraid.

00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:49.314
But if you are under
Her beautiful

00:12:49.522 --> 00:12:52.356
guidance and Her
blessings,

00:12:52.563 --> 00:12:55.814
you will never feel
afraid to do anything.

00:12:56.231 --> 00:12:58.563
You will never do
anything wrong also.

00:12:58.772 --> 00:13:02.605
As soon as you’ll try to do
wrong, She will hold your hand.

00:13:02.897 --> 00:13:05.397
She is really the
guiding person.

00:13:05.647 --> 00:13:09.647
She is the One who actually
gives us our existence.

00:13:09.939 --> 00:13:14.522
Without Her, we
cannot exist, because

00:13:14.939 --> 00:13:22.356
She is the One who is
the Power of Shri Shiva.

00:13:24.647 --> 00:13:28.772
She gives us so many things.
For example,

00:13:29.022 --> 00:13:35.314
She gives us the
relaxation, the sleep.

00:13:35.647 --> 00:13:37.939
She gives you the Truth.

00:13:38.396 --> 00:13:41.022
She tells you what is the
Truth and what is not.

00:13:41.272 --> 00:13:42.647
Sometimes people

00:13:42.897 --> 00:13:46.272
so much in their ego
always try to believe that:

00:13:46.438 --> 00:13:48.147
“What I think is
the truth.”

00:13:48.356 --> 00:13:54.438
Then She is the One who points
it out by creating a ‘Maya’,

00:13:54.688 --> 00:13:58.688
a kind of a confusion,

00:13:59.022 --> 00:14:02.396
that you start thinking:
“What is this?”

00:14:02.605 --> 00:14:08.022
So She is called also the One who
gives us ‘Bhranti,’ means illusions.

00:14:08.272 --> 00:14:11.480
She puts you to illusions
also. She tests you

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:14.272
puts you to illusions
and She

00:14:14.438 --> 00:14:18.022
then ultimately takes you
out of the illusions.

00:14:18.688 --> 00:14:20.855
She is the One who
relaxes you,

00:14:21.106 --> 00:14:24.438
because She takes over all
your responsibilities.

00:14:24.688 --> 00:14:26.897
She takes over all
your problems.

00:14:27.147 --> 00:14:29.356
She is the One who
solves all the problems.

00:14:29.522 --> 00:14:33.897
It is we who forget to leave
all the problems to Her.

00:14:34.147 --> 00:14:39.106
If you just leave problems to Her,
all your problems are solved.

00:14:39.356 --> 00:14:43.106
Not only that, but you
really feel blessed.

00:14:43.396 --> 00:14:47.563
It’s not only physical,
also it is mental

00:14:47.814 --> 00:14:52.231
that She makes your mind
absolutely free of worries.

00:14:52.438 --> 00:14:56.980
She doesn’t worry and She
doesn’t want you to worry.

00:14:57.231 --> 00:15:00.064
If you worry, then
She tries to show that,

00:15:00.272 --> 00:15:03.480
by your worry,
you are denying Her.

00:15:03.814 --> 00:15:06.106
You are not accepting Her.

00:15:06.396 --> 00:15:08.522
Worrying is something
very common

00:15:08.772 --> 00:15:10.438
and people take great
pride in saying:

00:15:10.688 --> 00:15:11.939
“Oh, I was worried.”

00:15:12.147 --> 00:15:16.939
How can you be worried when your
Mother is “Sakshat Mahakali”.

00:15:17.272 --> 00:15:20.897
She can kill all the demons.
She can finish all of them.

00:15:21.147 --> 00:15:22.855
She knows how
to manage things.

00:15:23.106 --> 00:15:26.147
And when you are like
a child before Her,

00:15:26.396 --> 00:15:28.730
how can you worry
about anything?

00:15:28.939 --> 00:15:31.522
So your worries
are finished.

00:15:31.814 --> 00:15:34.814
She worries about you, you
shouldn’t worry about yourself.

00:15:35.064 --> 00:15:39.730
That’s the point of it. Her
security is so great,

00:15:39.939 --> 00:15:43.106
She is so secure
Herself, that

00:15:43.314 --> 00:15:47.356
She gives you all the
security that you need.

00:15:47.605 --> 00:15:50.189
You can hold on
to Her feet.

00:15:50.396 --> 00:15:54.647
You can hold on to Her
image or to anything.

00:15:54.939 --> 00:15:56.814
You can even pray to Her.

00:15:57.022 --> 00:16:01.106
Many people are being cured
only by praying to Her.

00:16:01.356 --> 00:16:03.314
Because She cures you.

00:16:03.563 --> 00:16:05.480
She can cure your
diseases,

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:09.396
which are very complicated
diseases. She can cure.

00:16:09.772 --> 00:16:14.647
Now what She likes ?
Mahakali likes the light.

00:16:15.189 --> 00:16:19.356
She is worshipped in the night,
because then we can put on the light.

00:16:19.855 --> 00:16:22.688
She likes enlightened
persons.

00:16:22.897 --> 00:16:27.396
Also She likes the light.
She likes the Sun. She likes,

00:16:27.563 --> 00:16:33.064
something that will be completely
enlightened and brightened.

00:16:34.022 --> 00:16:38.438
You must have heard about people
who are called… I don’t know what,

00:16:38.688 --> 00:16:42.897
but especially in the
West they use them.

00:16:43.147 --> 00:16:47.647
They have big teeth
and they

00:16:48.272 --> 00:16:50.438
somebody from the audience
shouts: “vampires.”

00:16:50.688 --> 00:16:54.396
And they are the people,
they just imagine,

00:16:54.563 --> 00:16:58.563
they cannot exist
before the Sun.

00:16:58.772 --> 00:17:04.563
As soon as there is a sunrise,
they just want to go off and sleep.

00:17:04.814 --> 00:17:09.855
Yes, they cannot see the Sun,
because, the light, they can’t bear.

00:17:10.147 --> 00:17:14.522
Now, what has happened here,
that Mahalakshmi, has departed.

00:17:14.730 --> 00:17:17.897
Mahakali has departed
from them.

00:17:18.231 --> 00:17:23.106
And when Mahakali has departed,
then they are afraid.

00:17:23.356 --> 00:17:27.605
And such people are
attacked by these people

00:17:27.897 --> 00:17:30.522
who know they are afraid.

00:17:30.814 --> 00:17:35.064
The Sun itself is
very important,

00:17:35.314 --> 00:17:37.980
to work out this
Mahakali thing.

00:17:38.231 --> 00:17:41.814
But, as it is, in the
West especially,

00:17:42.064 --> 00:17:45.605
we are very hard-working

00:17:45.855 --> 00:17:50.480
and very much Sun-oriented
and we worship the Sun.

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:55.064
All this we do,
worship the Sun

00:17:55.314 --> 00:17:58.438
and also go right-sided
very much.

00:17:58.688 --> 00:18:01.272
Then it is She who
gives us the balance.

00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:04.855
She is the One who
gives us the balance,

00:18:05.106 --> 00:18:09.772
by relaxing us completely
and protecting us.

00:18:10.022 --> 00:18:15.396
Sometimes we are competitive
and we are really worried

00:18:15.563 --> 00:18:20.064
and we want to do something
which we cannot do.

00:18:20.438 --> 00:18:23.897
Then we get upset

00:18:24.106 --> 00:18:26.064
and we don’t know
what to do.

00:18:26.314 --> 00:18:31.106
Then it is She who
brings sleep to us.

00:18:31.314 --> 00:18:36.106
So, when we sleep, She looks
after us, She soothes us

00:18:36.356 --> 00:18:39.147
and She takes away
our problems.

00:18:39.356 --> 00:18:41.356
So many things
She is doing.

00:18:41.522 --> 00:18:45.106
But what are we doing for Her?
That we should see.

00:18:45.730 --> 00:18:47.688
Main thing is,

00:18:48.064 --> 00:18:54.064
that we are ourselves
worshipping Her.

00:18:55.231 --> 00:19:00.314
She likes it that Her
children should worship Her,

00:19:00.647 --> 00:19:04.189
that, on that level, She
can be One with them.

00:19:04.396 --> 00:19:09.396
She can give them Her
compassion, love and protection

00:19:09.605 --> 00:19:11.939
from all the evil.

00:19:12.147 --> 00:19:16.438
But it has to be
understood, those who are

00:19:16.688 --> 00:19:21.605
not yet settled, those
who are not absolutelly

00:19:21.855 --> 00:19:28.106
belonging to that land
of security of Mahakali,

00:19:28.396 --> 00:19:30.314
can be attacked.

00:19:30.522 --> 00:19:37.064
And they… once they leave that
area, they can be very badly

00:19:37.939 --> 00:19:41.814
injured, killed, whatever
way can happen.

00:19:42.022 --> 00:19:44.272
So, we are living in
this Kali Yuga

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:50.231
in very dangerous times.

00:19:50.397 --> 00:19:52.563
Whence anything
can happen.

00:19:52.814 --> 00:19:55.605
So we have to be
very careful.

00:19:55.855 --> 00:20:00.147
We have to watch our mind,
to see how it works.

00:20:00.396 --> 00:20:03.855
What does it teach you?
What does it tell you?

00:20:04.106 --> 00:20:05.688
Try to understand

00:20:05.939 --> 00:20:11.939
what is the plan of
this evil person,

00:20:12.231 --> 00:20:15.397
that you are playing
into his hands?

00:20:15.647 --> 00:20:17.897
How can you play
into his hands

00:20:18.106 --> 00:20:22.356
and how can you do whatever
wrong he wants you to do?

00:20:22.688 --> 00:20:26.106
Secondly, against
Her is the ego.

00:20:26.356 --> 00:20:29.855
The biggest problem
is the ego today.

00:20:30.231 --> 00:20:33.189
Ego will show:
“No, no, I can do this.”

00:20:33.396 --> 00:20:36.855
Ego says:
“I will work it out.”

00:20:37.314 --> 00:20:40.064
Ego says:
“It will be done.”

00:20:40.314 --> 00:20:44.814
But the human beings –
see – yield to ego.

00:20:45.064 --> 00:20:49.897
It’s of a great satisfaction to
them that their ego is so strong.

00:20:50.147 --> 00:20:55.563
and they don’t want to listen
to the Mahakali forces.

00:20:57.522 --> 00:21:00.730
Take the boy (Anant)
outside.

00:21:04.522 --> 00:21:07.563
He wants Me, you see.
Children are like that.

00:21:07.772 --> 00:21:11.396
They can’t leave
you for even…

00:21:16.605 --> 00:21:20.772
You have to be like children.
Really, that’s the very best way,

00:21:20.980 --> 00:21:25.396
is to be innocent like children.
She loves innocent people.

00:21:25.647 --> 00:21:29.438
She is Innocence Herself.
She loves innocent people

00:21:29.647 --> 00:21:32.106
and She looks after
you much more

00:21:32.314 --> 00:21:34.730
because you are innocent.
You are not cunning.

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:38.688
You are not very much...

00:21:39.939 --> 00:21:44.688
trying to play your
ego on others.

00:21:44.980 --> 00:21:47.980
If you are innocent,
She’ll help you.

00:21:48.231 --> 00:21:50.396
She definitely will
help you.

00:21:50.605 --> 00:21:54.147
But this ego has to be
brought under control,

00:21:54.396 --> 00:21:58.231
because he is
the worst enemy

00:21:58.438 --> 00:22:01.480
She has. She doesn’t
like your ego.

00:22:01.688 --> 00:22:04.855
She wants you to be
ego-less, to be innocent.

00:22:05.064 --> 00:22:11.480
As you know that it is, first She
came and She created Shri Ganesha

00:22:11.855 --> 00:22:15.231
That’s why we worship
Shri Ganesha.

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:17.396
We have to be innocent.

00:22:17.605 --> 00:22:21.897
Means: we are not
planning to do something

00:22:22.147 --> 00:22:26.980
bad or good or anything, but
we are without any intentions.

00:22:27.189 --> 00:22:35.064
We are just…It’s
a timeless activity.

00:22:35.272 --> 00:22:38.272
You just don’t bother about
what you are going to do,

00:22:38.480 --> 00:22:41.189
what you are not going to do,
what you should do.

00:22:41.396 --> 00:22:42.772
Nothing of the kind!

00:22:43.022 --> 00:22:47.563
You are just existing
in your complete innocence

00:22:47.814 --> 00:22:51.438
and enjoying yourself and
making others enjoy.

00:22:51.647 --> 00:22:55.897
If there’s one child in the house,
he can make hundred people dance.

00:22:56.147 --> 00:23:01.980
It’s like that. Because these
children have the power of innocence.

00:23:02.231 --> 00:23:07.647
and that is what She respects.
We sometimes feel that,

00:23:08.522 --> 00:23:11.356
how people are cheats.
How they cheat us!

00:23:11.522 --> 00:23:15.855
How they make
all kinds of,

00:23:16.605 --> 00:23:21.688
I should say - aggressiveness!
Sometimes, how they try to

00:23:21.939 --> 00:23:23.772
also tell lies!

00:23:23.980 --> 00:23:26.605
All kinds of things
they will do

00:23:26.855 --> 00:23:29.605
and they expect so
much from you also.

00:23:29.855 --> 00:23:34.688
But all this is
happening… is happening.

00:23:34.939 --> 00:23:36.772
You shouldn’t bother
about these things.

00:23:37.022 --> 00:23:38.980
You should keep
to your innocence

00:23:39.189 --> 00:23:43.563
and, you’ll be surprised,
you’ll be completely protected.

00:23:44.480 --> 00:23:49.438
How? Because Mahakali
will stand around you.

00:23:49.647 --> 00:23:53.647
She will look after you,
if you are innocent.

00:23:53.939 --> 00:23:58.480
Innocent person doesn’t get angry.
What is there to get angry?

00:23:58.730 --> 00:24:03.730
Innocence has its
own, I should say,

00:24:03.980 --> 00:24:08.772
strength, power. It’s
extremely powerful.

00:24:09.022 --> 00:24:12.396
Even a cruel man,
if he sees a child,

00:24:12.605 --> 00:24:16.189
he becomes a little bit aware
of it: “There’s a child.”

00:24:16.396 --> 00:24:20.064
The whole world is aware
that children should not be

00:24:20.314 --> 00:24:22.897
any way tortured
or troubled. Why?

00:24:23.189 --> 00:24:28.939
Because children are so innocent.
So the quality of innocence

00:24:29.189 --> 00:24:32.147
is going to really
help you very much,

00:24:32.396 --> 00:24:38.064
because She appreciates
your quality of innocence.

00:24:38.897 --> 00:24:43.356
Then another thing She loves
in you is your compassion.

00:24:43.605 --> 00:24:47.396
Compassion for each other.
Love for each other.

00:24:47.605 --> 00:24:52.772
Also caring for others. That
is something She loves.

00:24:53.189 --> 00:24:56.106
If you are a Sahaja Yogi, if
you are a Realised Soul,

00:24:56.396 --> 00:24:57.647
She is always with you.

00:24:57.897 --> 00:25:02.814
But She says: “What are you
doing with your compassion?

00:25:03.064 --> 00:25:05.396
How many people you are
giving Realisation?

00:25:05.605 --> 00:25:09.563
How many people
you are curing?

00:25:09.855 --> 00:25:11.772
How many people
you are helping?

00:25:12.064 --> 00:25:15.314
She is quite aware of
whatever you are doing.

00:25:15.480 --> 00:25:19.980
I should say, it’s such a
tremendous power of Mahakali

00:25:20.231 --> 00:25:23.314
that She knows
everything about you.

00:25:23.522 --> 00:25:25.939
Everything! She knows
your mind.

00:25:26.189 --> 00:25:27.897
She knows about
your heart.

00:25:28.189 --> 00:25:29.980
She knows about
your health.

00:25:30.231 --> 00:25:34.396
Everything She knows.
Actually, She is the Mother,

00:25:34.605 --> 00:25:39.356
in every way, who cares
for the little child.

00:25:39.605 --> 00:25:43.272
In that way, She knows that
this child doesn’t do anything.

00:25:43.522 --> 00:25:44.730
He’s very innocent.

00:25:44.980 --> 00:25:49.396
So, like, when you are very small,
your mother looks after you.

00:25:49.563 --> 00:25:53.396
In the same way, this
Mahakali looks after you.

00:25:53.647 --> 00:25:58.356
Then the Mahasaraswati
power comes in and She

00:25:58.772 --> 00:26:01.688
educates you.
She gives you

00:26:02.231 --> 00:26:06.438
other ideas of knowledge…
this, that.

00:26:06.688 --> 00:26:10.356
But, looking after
the child in you,

00:26:10.522 --> 00:26:14.980
looking after your innocence
and your compassion,

00:26:15.231 --> 00:26:17.855
is all done by this
Mahakali power.

00:26:18.064 --> 00:26:22.438
So, She is extremely sensitive
about Her children.

00:26:22.855 --> 00:26:25.189
Nobody dare touch
Her children!

00:26:25.396 --> 00:26:28.647
For Her, everybody
is like a child.

00:26:28.897 --> 00:26:32.855
Those who are Realised Souls
especially, She thinks are children

00:26:33.106 --> 00:26:35.563
and in no way they
should be hurt.

00:26:35.772 --> 00:26:39.356
Nothing should happen to them.
She is always following them.

00:26:39.522 --> 00:26:42.897
One can say: “If She is a ‘person’,
how does She follow them?”

00:26:43.147 --> 00:26:47.814
Because She is
‘omnipresent’.

00:26:48.147 --> 00:26:50.605
She is present
everywhere.

00:26:50.855 --> 00:26:54.314
Everywhere in your
life She is there.

00:26:54.730 --> 00:26:59.189
Especially with Sahaja Yogis,
She follows them up and down.

00:26:59.480 --> 00:27:00.730
Everywhere,

00:27:00.980 --> 00:27:02.522
whatever you are doing.
You are in an accident

00:27:02.730 --> 00:27:04.688
She is there to save you.

00:27:04.897 --> 00:27:09.688
She is like an angel behind you
and nothing can happen to you,

00:27:09.897 --> 00:27:13.438
if you really worship Her
from your full heart.

00:27:13.688 --> 00:27:18.438
Not for any gain, not
for any achievement,

00:27:18.647 --> 00:27:22.147
but for Her blessings.

00:27:22.438 --> 00:27:24.396
Her blessings are
very great

00:27:24.605 --> 00:27:29.189
and they really have
enriched human beings.

00:27:29.396 --> 00:27:33.397
They have enriched this Earth.
They have enriched everything,

00:27:33.647 --> 00:27:37.647
because of the
blessings of Mahakali.

00:27:38.356 --> 00:27:40.730
Of course, then, there
comes the Mahalakshmi.

00:27:40.980 --> 00:27:42.314
Her thing is that,

00:27:42.480 --> 00:27:47.897
in Mahalakshmi principle, you
become ‘sort of detached’.

00:27:48.189 --> 00:27:52.730
You start finding that:
“What is this world after all?”

00:27:52.980 --> 00:27:55.396
and a kind of a feeling

00:27:55.605 --> 00:28:00.730
of detachment comes into you
and you start thinking

00:28:00.980 --> 00:28:05.314
that there must be something better,
there must be truth beyond.

00:28:05.563 --> 00:28:08.980
Especially people who have
been tortured by bad people

00:28:09.231 --> 00:28:10.480
always think like that.

00:28:10.730 --> 00:28:15.231
That: “There must be someone
who will raise us from this.”

00:28:15.438 --> 00:28:18.647
Here comes the Mahalakshmi
principle in you

00:28:18.980 --> 00:28:21.939
which is the principle
of the Goddess

00:28:22.356 --> 00:28:26.605
of ‘Ascent’.

00:28:26.855 --> 00:28:31.688
She puts the ideas in your
head that: “What is next?

00:28:31.897 --> 00:28:36.980
What do we have to do? After all,
is this the end of our life?

00:28:37.231 --> 00:28:41.064
What is the purpose of our life?
Why have we come on this Earth?

00:28:41.314 --> 00:28:45.438
What is so special that we
should live on this Earth?”

00:28:45.730 --> 00:28:48.605
All such fundamental
questions start rising

00:28:48.855 --> 00:28:53.231
and then he just takes
to the seeking.

00:28:53.480 --> 00:28:55.939
In that also, you
have to understand

00:28:56.147 --> 00:28:59.397
the Mahalakshmi principle
is very, very,

00:28:59.647 --> 00:29:03.356
very different from what
people understand.

00:29:04.231 --> 00:29:06.022
They think -if
they are seeking,

00:29:06.272 --> 00:29:07.897
it should be intelligible,

00:29:08.106 --> 00:29:10.064
it should be through
their mindsall this…

00:29:10.272 --> 00:29:12.480
or could be rational

00:29:12.688 --> 00:29:14.855
or scientific.

00:29:15.064 --> 00:29:19.147
That’s how they move,
seeking the truth.

00:29:19.980 --> 00:29:21.814
It’s not possible!

00:29:22.231 --> 00:29:24.563
Mahalakshmi’s principle
is like this:

00:29:24.772 --> 00:29:27.356
that you should have earnest

00:29:27.522 --> 00:29:32.022
desire to know the Truth and Truth
and Truth – and nothing else.

00:29:32.605 --> 00:29:34.396
When you think like that,

00:29:34.605 --> 00:29:36.814
then you will not take
to other things.

00:29:37.022 --> 00:29:39.022
So many people took to drugs,

00:29:39.272 --> 00:29:43.396
thinking that, by doing that, they
will achieve their Self-Realisation.

00:29:43.563 --> 00:29:44.980
It’s a wrong idea.

00:29:45.231 --> 00:29:50.189
How can you get away from your awareness?
Can achieve that?

00:29:50.397 --> 00:29:54.647
Awareness is the most
important thing.

00:29:54.897 --> 00:29:57.605
If you can go

00:29:58.231 --> 00:30:01.855
into the realm
of awareness,

00:30:02.106 --> 00:30:06.605
then you have to understand that the
basic awareness is not to be lost.

00:30:06.855 --> 00:30:08.814
If your basic awareness
is lost,

00:30:09.106 --> 00:30:13.396
through drinking or through drugs
or all these things that people do.

00:30:13.563 --> 00:30:16.647
They think that they are seeking,
that’s why they are doing.

00:30:16.855 --> 00:30:23.064
So sometimes they take excuse of
‘seeking’ to do wrong things.

00:30:23.605 --> 00:30:27.147
It’s like a revenge on
your Self, I think,

00:30:27.356 --> 00:30:29.106
that you want
to revenge yourself

00:30:29.314 --> 00:30:33.939
by thinking that you
are now ‘seeking’.

00:30:34.189 --> 00:30:36.231
It’s not the real seeking.

00:30:36.397 --> 00:30:41.396
In a real seeking, a person
has to just meditate

00:30:41.605 --> 00:30:44.897
and should find out
what is the right way.

00:30:45.147 --> 00:30:47.730
But, that too, not by
reading some books

00:30:47.939 --> 00:30:50.480
or listening to
some false gurus.

00:30:50.688 --> 00:30:54.980
Actually, Kundalini
awakening is the only way

00:30:55.231 --> 00:30:58.688
one can know the Reality.
There’s no other way out.

00:30:58.939 --> 00:31:02.980
But nobody tells them that
it is Kundalini awakening.

00:31:03.272 --> 00:31:05.106
They’ll tell you:
“We’ll go to this place,

00:31:05.356 --> 00:31:07.605
then to that place,
then more to that place.

00:31:07.855 --> 00:31:09.106
Then this has
to be done…

00:31:09.356 --> 00:31:12.522
And, ultimately, where do
you come? Where you started!

00:31:13.022 --> 00:31:17.147
Just like that: moving
from places to places.

00:31:17.396 --> 00:31:20.605
Moving from false

00:31:20.855 --> 00:31:24.814
to another false, to another
false,… to falsehood.

00:31:25.314 --> 00:31:28.438
Ultimately so many
seekers have been lost.

00:31:28.730 --> 00:31:32.189
So many have been
lost, because

00:31:32.647 --> 00:31:38.772
they thought that certain
type of… is very precious,

00:31:39.189 --> 00:31:40.730
seeking is very ‘precious’,

00:31:40.980 --> 00:31:44.314
because you can pay lots
of money to the guru.

00:31:44.480 --> 00:31:46.438
I mean, you can
‘purchase’ the guru.

00:31:46.688 --> 00:31:50.231
And so: “All the rich people
can become enlightened.”

00:31:50.396 --> 00:31:51.563
That means that.

00:31:51.772 --> 00:31:56.980
But I don’t think that the percent-
age of good people are only rich.

00:31:57.231 --> 00:31:59.396
The people who are

00:31:59.605 --> 00:32:03.897
good are good. Whether they are
rich or not is not the point.

00:32:04.189 --> 00:32:07.814
But such people try to
gather round a person,

00:32:08.022 --> 00:32:11.939
because, I think, there’s a
subtle ego of their money,

00:32:12.189 --> 00:32:15.563
that: “We can afford to
buy this, buy that.”

00:32:16.064 --> 00:32:20.522
Once I was in America and there
was one lady who came to see Me

00:32:20.772 --> 00:32:24.980
and she didn’t know that I
was… a spiritual person.

00:32:25.231 --> 00:32:29.647
So she said: “Now there’s a very
good guru who has come to America.”

00:32:29.939 --> 00:32:31.480
I said: “Really?
What does he do?

00:32:31.772 --> 00:32:35.314
She said: “There’s a sale
on.” I said: “Really?”

00:32:35.605 --> 00:32:38.897
“You can pay him
half the amount:

00:32:39.189 --> 00:32:42.397
he can give you his blessings.
Alright?”

00:32:42.647 --> 00:32:47.106
Then next week, she said: “Now
the sale has come to one fourth.

00:32:47.396 --> 00:32:49.605
If you pay the one
fourth amount,

00:32:49.814 --> 00:32:52.272
then he will give you
the ‘full’ knowledge.”

00:32:52.438 --> 00:32:55.064
I said: “How can
it be reciprocal?

00:32:55.272 --> 00:32:57.438
It’s not proportionate!”
I said:

00:32:57.688 --> 00:33:00.814
“You were giving half,
he was giving you half,

00:33:01.022 --> 00:33:03.064
and when you are giving
one-fourth, he is giving you full.”

00:33:03.314 --> 00:33:04.939
“That’s the thing”
she said,

00:33:05.147 --> 00:33:09.314
“he’s very magnanimous, you see.
That’s the point.”

00:33:09.814 --> 00:33:14.814
I said: “For all such people who
think they can purchase Truth,

00:33:15.064 --> 00:33:19.396
they cannot achieve it.
You cannot purchase it.

00:33:20.189 --> 00:33:24.480
You cannot pay for your
Kundalini awakening. No!

00:33:24.814 --> 00:33:27.647
Nor you should take any
payment for that.

00:33:27.897 --> 00:33:33.563
Self-Realisation is
absolutely the Divine Grace.

00:33:33.855 --> 00:33:37.772
And you cannot take
money for that.

00:33:38.563 --> 00:33:42.605
You cannot sell it. It’s not
so ‘cheap’ to be sold.

00:33:42.897 --> 00:33:48.231
If you understand that, then
the Mahalakshmi power works.

00:33:48.563 --> 00:33:50.438
And Mahalakshmi power is

00:33:50.688 --> 00:33:53.939
really meant for people who
are really genuine seekers,

00:33:54.231 --> 00:33:59.314
who are really seeking genuinely.
It acts and works so well,

00:33:59.563 --> 00:34:04.688
that they achieve a
kind of a very, very

00:34:04.980 --> 00:34:08.106
spontaneous Realisation.

00:34:08.563 --> 00:34:12.563
This spontaneous Realisation,
you all have got it.

00:34:12.855 --> 00:34:16.897
You don’t have to go to Himalayas. You
don’t have to do anything like that.

00:34:17.106 --> 00:34:21.396
All those things are over.
You have done it.

00:34:21.647 --> 00:34:24.189
In your previous lives,
you must have done it.

00:34:24.396 --> 00:34:25.939
Now you don’t have
to do anything.

00:34:26.189 --> 00:34:30.272
You can get it, you are getting
it just sitting down here.

00:34:30.480 --> 00:34:33.772
Wherever you are in the
whole world, you can get it

00:34:34.022 --> 00:34:35.897
and it is spreading
very fast.

00:34:36.106 --> 00:34:42.438
Now, it’s also the duty of Sahaja
Yogis to spread Sahaja Yoga.

00:34:43.438 --> 00:34:47.396
Now, this one is

00:34:47.605 --> 00:34:51.730
to be understood: that
Mahalakshmi and Mahakali

00:34:52.064 --> 00:34:55.814
both go hand in hand.

00:34:56.064 --> 00:35:00.314
When, you see,
Mahakali blesses you

00:35:00.522 --> 00:35:04.064
and She is with you and
you are in Her realm,

00:35:04.272 --> 00:35:06.189
the Mahalakshmi comes
forward

00:35:06.396 --> 00:35:10.106
and She definitely helps you
to achieve your Realisation

00:35:10.356 --> 00:35:14.647
and also to improve
your problems,

00:35:14.855 --> 00:35:18.814
to help you. I mean - the financial
side of it, you can call it,

00:35:19.064 --> 00:35:20.772
or in any way other

00:35:20.980 --> 00:35:25.106
problems also She solves. The
greatest problem She solves

00:35:25.314 --> 00:35:31.022
that your greatest desire to achieve
Self-Realisation, is granted.

00:35:31.438 --> 00:35:34.522
So, there is no competition
between Them.

00:35:34.814 --> 00:35:38.356
All these three powers
work together,

00:35:38.563 --> 00:35:42.396
and, whatever is needed,
they work it out.

00:35:42.647 --> 00:35:48.272
But it is the Mahakali who
guides where what help has to go

00:35:48.480 --> 00:35:53.772
and that’s why the power of
Mahakali is very much respected.

00:35:54.022 --> 00:36:00.438
As it is, She has killed so many
devils and so many rakshasas

00:36:00.688 --> 00:36:04.396
and there are still more –
some of them are existing

00:36:04.563 --> 00:36:06.688
but I am sure they
will be all finished.

00:36:06.897 --> 00:36:12.563
There will be none of these
horrible ones ever existing.

00:36:12.814 --> 00:36:17.314
But still we have to be
very careful and alert

00:36:17.480 --> 00:36:20.980
and try to find out what’s
wrong with these people.

00:36:21.189 --> 00:36:26.272
What are they doing and what
they trying to propagate?

00:36:26.480 --> 00:36:30.396
You must mature in
such a manner that

00:36:30.605 --> 00:36:35.730
you should know everything
of all these evil doers.

00:36:35.980 --> 00:36:39.814
You must find out what these
false people are doing.

00:36:40.022 --> 00:36:43.939
See, it’s really easy, because
you are enlightened.

00:36:44.189 --> 00:36:48.272
And with your enlightened attention,
you can definitely find out

00:36:48.438 --> 00:36:52.980
what’s wrong with
what organisation,

00:36:53.231 --> 00:36:57.272
with each evil man,
evildoer.

00:36:57.438 --> 00:37:00.855
It will be… the best
way is to meditate.

00:37:01.064 --> 00:37:03.022
Not to be aggressive
in any way.

00:37:03.231 --> 00:37:07.939
But just to meditate and
ask Mahakali: “Destroy!

00:37:08.231 --> 00:37:12.480
Destroy him, for he is destroying
the world. You please destroy him!”

00:37:12.688 --> 00:37:14.939
That’s Her job and
She’d love to do it,

00:37:15.147 --> 00:37:17.939
but somebody has to
tell Her and ask Her.

00:37:18.189 --> 00:37:21.314
It’s very good, because
there are so many,

00:37:21.480 --> 00:37:23.855
that unless and until
you point it out,

00:37:24.106 --> 00:37:27.314
She may not be able to put Her
attention to that - possibly.

00:37:27.480 --> 00:37:31.980
So it’s best is always
ask Her to help you.

00:37:32.189 --> 00:37:35.772
On individual basis.
On a national basis.

00:37:35.980 --> 00:37:40.730
Maybe on a collective basis
or maybe on a global basis.

00:37:40.939 --> 00:37:46.022
That’s what. She exists everywhere.
She is globally available.

00:37:46.272 --> 00:37:48.272
Anywhere: you may
be having

00:37:48.438 --> 00:37:53.189
any colour, any race,
any nation - anything.

00:37:53.396 --> 00:37:57.064
but She exists within
you all the time.

00:37:57.272 --> 00:38:00.772
And to worship Her
and to awaken Her,

00:38:01.022 --> 00:38:04.855
is only ‘your’ due,
that ‘you’ have to do.

00:38:05.064 --> 00:38:08.397
If She is awakened within you,
you’ll be a humble person.

00:38:08.605 --> 00:38:11.231
You will see what mistakes
you have been committing

00:38:11.438 --> 00:38:14.939
and you’ll feel bad about it.
You will not feel ‘guilty’,

00:38:15.189 --> 00:38:16.147
but you will feel ‘bad’,

00:38:16.396 --> 00:38:19.356
that: I will never do such a thing.
I have done very great wrong.

00:38:19.522 --> 00:38:21.814
And then you will
try to correct it.

00:38:22.064 --> 00:38:24.480
All this works out

00:38:24.688 --> 00:38:28.397
very well when you are
pure in your heart.

00:38:28.647 --> 00:38:32.814
Your heart should be pure.
If your heart is not pure,

00:38:33.022 --> 00:38:40.272
if you are doing Sahaja Yoga to
have some competition with others

00:38:40.438 --> 00:38:45.480
or with some sort of material
achievements, it will not work out.

00:38:45.855 --> 00:38:51.272
You have to do it in a way
that is an innocent act,

00:38:51.605 --> 00:38:55.064
that you are worshipping your
Mother like a little child

00:38:55.272 --> 00:38:57.106
worships and loves
his mother.

00:38:57.356 --> 00:39:01.189
It’s a very simple relationship,
which all of us have felt,

00:39:01.397 --> 00:39:04.106
how we should love
our Mother and

00:39:04.356 --> 00:39:09.730
how we should be under Her
guidance and under Her protection.

00:39:09.980 --> 00:39:13.605
That is something very simple you
have known in your childhood

00:39:13.855 --> 00:39:16.730
and that childhood has
to come back in you

00:39:16.939 --> 00:39:19.772
if you really
worship the Mother.

00:39:20.064 --> 00:39:23.231
May God Bless you.